        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Once a customer contracts for the nCino Platform, we provide implementation services to assist in the deployment, either directly or through our system integration (“SI”) partner ecosystem.",
        "start_character": 20681,
        "end_character": 20870
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001902733-26-000022",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001902733-26-000022-a2f716036ae2ec22",
        "accession_number": "0001902733-26-000022",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe our success in growing our business will depend on our ability to demonstrate to FIs that our solutions provide superior business outcomes and value to those of competitors, AI-focused startups, or internally developed systems.",
        "start_character": 25475,
        "end_character": 25713
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001902733-26-000022",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001902733-26-000022-a2f716036ae2ec22",
        "accession_number": "0001902733-26-000022",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We initially focused on developing the nCino Platform to transform commercial and small business lending for community and regional banks in the U.S.",
        "start_character": 2774,
        "end_character": 2923
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001902733-26-000022",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001902733-26-000022-a2f716036ae2ec22",
        "accession_number": "0001902733-26-000022",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As a pioneer in cloud banking, we have developed trusted relationships and a reputation for successfully implementing our solutions with FIs of all sizes in multiple geographies.",
        "start_character": 12444,
        "end_character": 12622
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001902733-26-000022",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001902733-26-000022-a2f716036ae2ec22",
        "accession_number": "0001902733-26-000022",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As part of our priority to drive success through brand reputation and excellence, we listen to our employees and develop involvement programs that foster belonging and deliver value back to our communities.",
        "start_character": 30237,
        "end_character": 30443
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001902733-26-000022",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001902733-26-000022-a2f716036ae2ec22",
        "accession_number": "0001902733-26-000022",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Pursuant to our agreement with Salesforce, when we sell certain solutions, we include a subscription to the underlying Salesforce Platform and remit a subscription fee to Salesforce.",
        "start_character": 18591,
        "end_character": 18773
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001902733-26-000022",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001902733-26-000022-a2f716036ae2ec22",
        "accession_number": "0001902733-26-000022",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "To ensure our ability to attract and retain the very best global talent, we offer market competitive compensation that is consistently evaluated, opportunities for equity ownership, savings options to help employees invest in their future, and generous, country-specific benefit packages.",
        "start_character": 31729,
        "end_character": 32017
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001902733-26-000022",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001902733-26-000022-a2f716036ae2ec22",
        "accession_number": "0001902733-26-000022",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Under our agreement with Salesforce, we are an authorized reseller of Salesforce’s customer relationship management (“CRM”) solution functionality to certain FIs in the U.S.",
        "start_character": 18967,
        "end_character": 19140
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001902733-26-000022",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001902733-26-000022-a2f716036ae2ec22",
        "accession_number": "0001902733-26-000022",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We invested 21.4% of our revenues back into research and development in fiscal 2026, and we expect to continue to invest in fiscal 2027 to further extend the breadth and depth of the nCino Platform.",
        "start_character": 15421,
        "end_character": 15619
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001902733-26-000022",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001902733-26-000022-a2f716036ae2ec22",
        "accession_number": "0001902733-26-000022",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We utilize industry-standard software development practices, including continuous integration and continuous deployment (“CI/CD”), automated testing frameworks, and distributed version control systems, to develop new functionality and enhance our existing solutions.",
        "start_character": 22439,
        "end_character": 22705
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001902733-26-000022",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001902733-26-000022-a2f716036ae2ec22",
        "accession_number": "0001902733-26-000022",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "Leveraging our acquisition of Sandbox Banking, now nCino Integration Gateway, we are focused on scaling our ecosystem strategy and business model to supplement our existing direct sales model.",
        "start_character": 16545,
        "end_character": 16737
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001902733-26-000022",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001902733-26-000022-a2f716036ae2ec22",
        "accession_number": "0001902733-26-000022",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "We deliver our solutions as secure, highly scalable cloud computing application and platform services with a multi-tenant technology and shared service-oriented architecture.",
        "start_character": 32063,
        "end_character": 32237
      }
    ]
